# Only the free fonts below ship with the app; every other font comes from the
# device it runs on.
# - DejaVu Sans: inserted text extracts correctly on every OS (system Arial maps
#   space/NBSP and hyphen/soft-hyphen to one glyph, which corrupts copy/search).
# - Liberation Sans/Serif/Mono (SIL OFL 1.1): metric-compatible with Arial,
#   Times New Roman and Courier New, so edits keep the layout on devices that
#   don't have the Microsoft fonts.
*
!.gitignore
!DejaVuSans.ttf
!DejaVuSans-Bold.ttf
!DejaVu-LICENSE.txt
!Liberation*.ttf
!Liberation-LICENSE.txt
